Android DiT kernel changes adapted from Nightmare Mobile
Copyright (c) 2026 Abraham Paul Jaison

https://github.com/AbrahamPaulJ/nightmare-mobile/tree/aa512f4f03ad61bec927c03134fb1d8dc8ca3952/backend-patches/dit

Hexagon patches 030, 031, 039, 040, 041, 063 and 065 were adapted to
this fork's session lifetime, tensor address ranges, DMA queues, VTCM
layout and masked attention. The session self-test is opt-in here.
OpenCL patches 067, 080, 081 and 085 were adapted to this fork's
device discovery, graph execution and shared-library build.

Nightmare Mobile identifies its own contributions as CC BY-NC 4.0.
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
https://github.com/AbrahamPaulJ/nightmare-mobile/blob/aa512f4f03ad61bec927c03134fb1d8dc8ca3952/NOTICE

Patch 067 incorporates the Mali and older-driver work from Fancy AI
(Apache-2.0), https://github.com/Mr-J-369/Fancy-Ai .
Patch 081 incorporates happyyzy's QKV preprocessing changes (MIT),
https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/28446 .
